{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# OddsIQ Architecture\n\nAsync detection pipeline: poll Tipsport (the single soft book) vs Pinnacle (via The Odds API, which is also the schedule/scores source) → match teams → vig-remove → detect +EV moneyline edges → measure CLV → log detections; Telegram only for real-money bet events. Five sports profiled (NBA / NHL / MLB / WNBA / NFL), MLB + NFL enabled. Read-only multi-sport dashboard layered on top. Polling is pregame-only (the live-edge subsystem was removed 2026-08-27).",
      "x": -1480,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 2680,
      "height": 110
    },
    {
      "id": "group-external",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -1480,
