      "text": "## Legend\n\n- **Red** (1) → Ingestion\n- **Purple** (6) → Orchestration\n- **Cyan** (5) → Data Layer\n- **Green** (4) → Detection Engine\n- **Yellow** (3) → Output\n- _Plain_ → External APIs",
